observed = "Task 23.1 implemented a complete mandate verification test harness with structures for golden vectors conforming to AP2 spec commit e1ea56db72a6385bce3e5c1112b3a56ce60acb43, but the actual cryptographic test material (properly signed SD-JWTs with real keys) is placeholder-only until the published AP2 specification test suite is integrated."
assumption = "Human qualification will fetch the official AP2 reference test vectors from the pinned specification commit and populate interop/crates/layerx-ap2/tests/vectors/ with real signed mandate pairs before production use."
